ling `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode is NOT sufficient. It only prepares the selected Skill invocation. After `prepare`, you MUST actually execute the selected Skill workflow.\n- After `invoke_skill(mode=\"prepare\")` returns `legacy_invocation.container_skill_file`, you MUST read that Skill file and treat it as the authoritative execution guide.\n- If the Skill provides scripts, commands, templates, references, or executable workflows, you MUST use those Skill-provided assets first.\n- Do NOT replace a matched Skill workflow with ad hoc Python, pandas, SQL, shell, or manual analysis code before attempting the Skill workflow.\n- For `data-analysis`, if `/mnt/skills/public/data-analysis/scripts/analyze.py` is available and the task is structured data analysis, you MUST call that script first for data inspection, SQL query, aggregation, statistics, or chart preparation. Do not write standalone pandas code for the same operation before trying this script.\n- Custom code is allowed only after one of these conditions is true:\n  1. the selected Skill file does not provide a suitable executable workflow;\n  2. the Skill-provided script or workflow has been attempted and failed;\n  3. the user explicitly requests custom code;\n  4. the required operation is clearly outside the Skill's documented capability.\n- When you fall back to custom code, briefly state that the Skill workflow was insufficient or failed, and continue from the Skill result or error.\n\n**Skill Loading Priority Rules:**\n- If a request clearly matches an available skill and also includes uploaded files, load the skill file before reading uploaded data files.\n- Do NOT read a full uploaded structured data file before loading the matched skill.\n- For uploaded structured data files, use small previews only when needed.\n- Prefer the matched skill's scripts, workflows, or tools for actual analysis.\n- Do not start by generating ad hoc JS, Python, SQL, or shell scripts when a matched skill exists.\n- Only improvise custom code after loading the matched skill and confirming the skill does not already provide a suitable workflow.\n\n**Skills are located at:** /mnt/skills\n\n<available_skills>\n</available_skills>\n\n</skill_system>","additional_kwargs":{"message_type":"routed_skill_prompt","internal":true},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"routing_skill_guidance","id":"613cfa55-5b8b-4323-a428-cff24e0f4c01"}],"viewed_images":{},"intent_context":{"intent":"task","original_query":"请统计视频中各时间段的人数，判断是否出现人群聚集、密度突然升高或超过设定阈值的情况。","normalized_query":"请统计视频中各时间段的人数，判断是否出现人群聚集、密度突然升高或超过设定阈值的情况。","routing_query":"场景：视频监控。场景ID：video_surveillance。场景说明：视频监控、摄像头、监控录像、视频流、实时画面、视频帧、卡口、安防巡检、目标检测、行为识别、事件发现和监控告警分析场景。需要识别参数：视频对象、监控目标、时间范围、输出形式。用户原始问题：我将统计视频中各时间段的人数，并判断是否出现人群聚集、密度突然升高或超过设定阈值的情况","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","params":{"视频对象":"视频","监控目标":"人数统计、人群聚集、密度突然升高、超过设定阈值","时间范围":"各时间段"},"scene_mode":"single","scenes":["video_surveillance"],"task_spans":[{"task_span_id":"span_789eb1","text":"请统计视频中各时间段的人数，判断是否出现人群聚集、密度突然升高或超过设定阈值的情况。"}],"planning_steps":[{"task_span_id":"span_64a500","text":"读取输入视频文件并解析元数据，按预设时间粒度将视频流切分为独立帧序列，建立时间戳与图像片段的映射关系，输出结构化时间轴与待处理帧缓存。"},{"task_span_id":"span_ffcc77","text":"调用视频监控场景的目标检测能力，对每个时间片段执行行人识别与去重计数，统计各时间段内的人员数量指标，输出带时间戳的原始人数时序数据集。"},{"task_span_id":"span_a5e9ea","text":"基于各时段人数与监控画面有效覆盖区域计算人群密度指标，采用滑动窗口法识别密度骤升节点，并将计算结果与预设安全阈值进行比对，标记触发聚集或超限的时间区间及偏差幅度。"},{"task_span_id":"span_a4ab2f","text":"对人数统计与密度研判结果进行逻辑校验与噪声过滤，剔除模型误检或跳变干扰，整合生成包含时间段、实时人数、密度值、阈值状态及异常类型的结构化中间表。"},{"task_span_id":"span_957d74","text":"汇总校验后的时序数据与告警记录，生成可回溯的时间轴分析报告，重点标注人群聚集与密度突增的具体区间，输出最终统计表格与关键指标摘要以供调度决策。"}],"scene_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_ea7ba9","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"我将统计视频中各时间段的人数，并判断是否出现人群聚集、密度突然升高或超过设定阈值的情况。","params":{"视频对象":"视频","监控目标":"人数统计、人群聚集、密度突然升高、超过设定阈值","时间范围":"各时间段"}}],"sub_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_ea7ba9","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"我将统计视频中各时间段的人数，并判断是否出现人群聚集、密度突然升高或超过设定阈值的情况。","params":{"视频对象":"视频","监控目标":"人数统计、人群聚集、密度突然升高、超过设定阈值","时间范围":"各时间段"}}],"task_hints":["提取必填参数：视频对象。需要分析的监控视频、摄像头、视频流、录像文件、实时画面、卡口视频或视频帧","提取可选参数：监控目标。需要识别或分析的对象、行为或事件，如人员聚集、车辆违停、越界、烟火、异常停留、摔倒、入侵、打架、遗留物、通行计数等","提取可选参数：时间范围。视频分析的起止时间、日期、时段、时刻或实时窗口","提取可选参数：输出形式。用户期望的输出，如告警、截图、时间点清单、检测结果、表格、报告、标注说明或风险摘要"],"mentioned_skill_ids":[],"confidence":0.9,"reason":"llm_scene_slot_rewrite","_source_message_key":"id:ce4a52fb-fb88-4a4e-8a57-0645cb3ab70a"},"routing_context":{"route_mode":"scene_filter","trigger":false,"primary_goal":"请统计视频中各时间段的人数，判断是否出现人群聚集、密度突然升高或超过设定阈值的情况。","scene_tasks":[{"scene_task_id":"task_001","segment_id":"seg_001","segment_text":"请统计视频中各时间段的人数，判断是否出现人群聚集、密度突然升高或超过设定阈值的情况。","scene":"video_surveillance","input_refs":[],"task_types":[],"selected_skills":[],"expected_outputs":[],"depends_on":[]}],"global_selected_skills":[],"default_public_skill_ids":[],"global_allowed_tools":[],"confidence":0.0,"route_reason":"SkillRouter disabled; injected all custom skills for detected intent scene as LeadAgent candidate skills","allowed_skills":[],"selection_owner":"lead_agent","_source_message_key":"id:ce4a52fb-fb88-4a4e-8a57-0645cb3ab70a"},"dialogue_context":{"act":"new_task","confidence":0.7,"reason":"no_pending_action_match","parsed_answer":null,"pending_action_id":null,"resume_intent_context":null,"resume_routing_context":null,"metadata":{}},"final_scope_skill_ids":[],"allowed_tool_names":[]}

event: values
data: {"messages":[{"content":"请统计视频中各时间段的人数，判断是否出现人群聚集、密度突然升高或超过设定阈值的情况。","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":null,"id":"ce4a52fb-fb88-4a4e-8a57-0645cb3ab70a"},{"content":"<skill_system source=\"skill_router\">\nYou have access to skills that provide optimized workflows for specific tasks. Each skill contains best practices, frameworks, and references to additional resources.\n\n**Skill Availability Rules:**\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt are available across turns.\n- Custom/domain skills are available only when listed in a current-turn routed <available_skills> section.\n- Ignore custom/domain skills mentioned in previous turns if they are not listed in the current turn.\n- Do not call tools associated with unavailable skills.\n- If a later current-turn routed_skill_prompt is injected by SkillRouter, its <available_skills> list recommends the custom/domain skills for this turn; public skills from the base prompt remain available as supporting workflows.\n- When SkillRouter ranking is disabled and scene filtering injects all skills for a scene, treat <available_skills> as an allowed candidate set. Select the specific skill or skills that match the current user request before loading skill files or executing workflows.\n\nScene skill filter result: SkillRouter ranking is disabled. Detected scene(s): video_surveillance. The listed custom/domain skills are all enabled skills for the detected scene. Treat them as an allowed candidate set, choose the specific matching skill or skills for the task, and then load only the chosen skill file(s). Public skills from the base prompt remain available.\nTask: 请统计视频中各时间段的人数，判断是否出现人群聚集、密度突然升高或超过设定阈值的情况。\n\n**Current Available Skills:**\n- The current <available_skills> list is empty.\n- No routed custom/domain skill matched this turn.\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt remain available.\n\n**Override Scope:**\n- This routed <skill_system> lists recommended custom/domain skills for the current turn.\n- It does NOT replace the base system prompt.\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt remain available for supporting operations.\n- When uploaded structured files (Excel, CSV, JSON, Parquet, or similar tabular evidence) are central to the user's request, use the public data-analysis skill first to inspect and extract facts before domain synthesis.\n- Continue following language_policy, clarification_system, working_directory, response_style, and critical_reminders from the base system prompt.\n\n**Progressive Loading Pattern:**\n1. When a user query matches an available skill's use case, first choose the concrete skill.\n2. Call `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode for that selected skill to create and validate the SkillInputEnvelope and legacy invocation package.\n3. Read the returned skill file path and understand the skill's workflow and instructions.\n4. The skill file contains references to external resources under the same folder.\n5. Load referenced resources only when needed during execution.\n6. Follow the skill's instructions precisely.\n7. After legacy execution, call `invoke_skill` in `wrap_output` mode to normalize the result into SkillResult when a machine-readable Skill output is needed.\n\n**Mandatory Skill Execution Discipline:**\n- Calling `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode is NOT sufficient. It only prepares the selected Skill invocation. After `prepare`, you MUST actually execute the selected Skill workflow.\n- After `invoke_skill(mode=\"prepare\")` returns `legacy_invocation.container_skill_file`, you MUST read that Skill file and treat it as the authoritative execution guide.\n- If the Skill provides scripts, commands, templates, references, or executable workflows, you MUST use those Skill-provided assets first.\n- Do NOT replace a matched Skill workflow with ad hoc Python, pandas, SQL, shell, or manual analysis code before attempting the Skill workflow.\n- For `data-analysis`, if `/mnt/skills/public/data-analysis/scripts/analyze.py` is available and the task is structured data analysis, you MUST call that script first for data inspection, SQL query, aggregation, statistics, or chart preparation. Do not write standalone pandas code for the same operation before trying this script.\n- Custom code is allowed only after one of these conditions is true:\n  1. the selected Skill file does not provide a suitable executable workflow;\n  2. the Skill-provided script or workflow has been attempted and failed;\n  3. the user explicitly requests custom code;\n  4. the required operation is clearly outside the Skill's documented capability.\n- When you fall back to custom code, briefly state that the Skill workflow was insufficient or failed, and continue from the Skill result or error.\n\n**Skill Loading Priority Rules:**\n- If a request clearly matches an available skill and also includes uploaded files, load the skill file before reading uploaded data files.\n- Do NOT read a full uploaded structured data file before loading the matched skill.\n- For uploaded structured data files, use small previews only when needed.\n- Prefer the matched skill's scripts, workflows, or tools for actual analysis.\n- Do not start by generating ad hoc JS, Python, SQL, or shell scripts when a matched skill exists.\n- Only improvise custom code after loading the matched skill and confirming the skill does not already provide a suitable workflow.\n\n**Skills are located at:** /mnt/skills\n\n<available_skills>\n</available_skills>\n\n</skill_system>","additional_kwargs":{"message_type":"routed_skill_prompt","internal":true},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"routing_skill_guidance","id":"613cfa55-5b8b-4323-a428-cff24e0f4c01"},{"content":"<system_reminder>\nUse the following current-turn intent and routing guidance when deciding whether to create or update todos. Treat it as planning context, not as a user request.\n<hidden_step source=\"intent_recognition\" title=\"意图识别\">\n改写后的任务：场景：视频监控。场景ID：video_surveillance\n识别场景：视频监控 (video_surveillance)；场景模式：single；候选场景：video_surveillance\n任务切分：\n- 请统计视频中各时间段的人数，判断是否出现人群聚集、密度突然升高或超过设定阈值的情况。\n任务规划：\n1. 读取输入视频文件并解析元数据，按预设时间粒度将视频流切分为独立帧序列，建立时间戳与图像片段的映射关系，输出结构化时间轴与待处理帧缓存。\n2. 调用视频监控场景的目标检测能力，对每个时间片段执行行人识别与去重计数，统计各时间段内的人员数量指标，输出带时间戳的原始人数时序数据集。\n3. 基于各时段人数与监控画面有效覆盖区域计算人群密度指标，采用滑动窗口法识别密度骤升节点，并将计算结果与预设安全阈值进行比对，标记触发聚集或超限的时间区间及偏差幅度。\n4. 对人数统计与密度研判结果进行逻辑校验与噪声过滤，剔除模型误检或跳变干扰，整合生成包含时间段、实时人数、密度值、阈值状态及异常类型的结构化中间表。\n5. 汇总校验后的时序数据与告警记录，生成可回溯的时间轴分析报告，重点标注人群聚集与密度突增的具体区间，输出最终统计表格与关键指标摘要以供调度决策。\n场景任务：\n- video_surveillance: 我将统计视频中各时间段的人数，并判断是否出现人群聚集、密度突然升高或超过设定阈值的情况。；参数：{'视频对象': '视频', '监控目标': '人数统计、人群聚集、密度突然升高、超过设定阈值', '时间范围': '各时间段'}\n已提取参数：{'视频对象': '视频', '监控目标': '人数统计、人群聚集、密度突然升高、超过设定阈值', '时间范围': '各时间段'}\n任务提示：\n- 提取必填参数：视频对象。需要分析的监控视频、摄像头、视频流、录像文件、实时画面、卡口视频或视频帧\n- 提取可选参数：监控目标。需要识别或分析的对象、行为或事件，如人员聚集、车辆违停、越界、烟火、异常停留、摔倒、入侵、打架、遗留物、通行计数等\n- 提取可选参数：时间范围。视频分析的起止时间、日期、时段、时刻或实时窗口\n- 提取可选参数：输出形式。用户期望的输出，如告警、截图、时间点清单、检测结果、表格、报告、标注说明或风险摘要\n</hidden_step>\n</system_reminder>","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"todo_routing_guidance","id":"befdf7f0-142c-4d42-982a-e05fd56d0dfd"},{"content":"我需要分析视频中的行人数量和聚集情况，但目前缺少关键信息：\n\n**请提供以下信息：**\n\n1. **视频文件路径** - 您想分析的视频文件位于哪个路径？例如：\n   - `/mnt/user-data/uploads/video.mp4`（已上传的视频）\n   - `/mnt/datasets/xxx.mp4`（服务器内置数据集）\n   - 或其他具体路径\n\n2. **时间采样间隔**（可选）- 希望每隔多少秒统计一次人数？默认使用1秒间隔。\n\n3. **人群密度阈值**（可选）- 超过多少人算\"人群聚集\"？如果没有设定，我将自动识别异常峰值。\n\n请先告诉我视频文件的具体路径，我就可以立即开始分析。","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":322,"prompt_tokens":10957,"total_tokens":11279,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":163,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":322},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":10957}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-7feb2ab0-184a-9b8f-9ee5-0f0083e0d437","finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f8f5b-d16b-72e2-858a-40e676279cd4-0","tool_calls":[],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":10957,"output_tokens":322,"total_tokens":11279,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":163}}}],"thread_data":{"workspace_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/c06c20bd-6016-4f4a-a65c-acce2733642a/user-data/workspace","uploads_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/c06c20bd-6016-4f4a-a65c-acce2733642a/user-data/uploads","outputs_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/c06c20bd-6016-4f4a-a65c-acce2733642a/user-data/outputs"},"title":"视频人群密度分析","artifacts":[],"raw_messages":[{"content":"请统计视频中各时间段的人数，判断是否出现人群聚集、密度突然升高或超过设定阈值的情况。","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":null,"id":"ce4a52fb-fb88-4a4e-8a57-0645cb3ab70a"},{"content":"<skill_system source=\"skill_router\">\nYou have access to skills that provide optimized workflows for specific tasks. Each skill contains best practices, frameworks, and references to additional resources.\n\n**Skill Availability Rules:**\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt are available across turns.\n- Custom/domain skills are available only when listed in a current-turn routed <available_skills> section.\n- Ignore custom/domain skills mentioned in previous turns if they are not listed in the current turn.\n- Do not call tools associated with unavailable skills.\n- If a later current-turn routed_skill_prompt is injected by SkillRouter, its <available_skills> list recommends the custom/domain skills for this turn; public skills from the base prompt remain available as supporting workflows.\n- When SkillRouter ranking is disabled and scene filtering injects all skills for a scene, treat <available_skills> as an allowed candidate set. Select the specific skill or skills that match the current user request before loading skill files or executing workflows.\n\nScene skill filter result: SkillRouter ranking is disabled. Detected scene(s): video_surveillance. The listed custom/domain skills are all enabled skills for the detected scene. Treat them as an allowed candidate set, choose the specific matching skill or skills for the task, and then load only the chosen skill file(s). Public skills from the base prompt remain available.\nTask: 请统计视频中各时间段的人数，判断是否出现人群聚集、密度突然升高或超过设定阈值的情况。\n\n**Current Available Skills:**\n- The current <available_skills> list is empty.\n- No routed custom/domain skill matched this turn.\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt remain available.\n\n**Override Scope:**\n- This routed <skill_system> lists recommended custom/domain skills for the current turn.\n- It does NOT replace the base system prompt.\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt remain available for supporting operations.\n- When uploaded structured files (Excel, CSV, JSON, Parquet, or similar tabular evidence) are central to the user's request, use the public data-analysis skill first to inspect and extract facts before domain synthesis.\n- Continue following language_policy, clarification_system, working_directory, response_style, and critical_reminders from the base system prompt.\n\n**Progressive Loading Pattern:**\n1. When a user query matches an available skill's use case, first choose the concrete skill.\n2. Call `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode for that selected skill to create and validate the SkillInputEnvelope and legacy invocation package.\n3. Read the returned skill file path and understand the skill's workflow and instructions.\n4. The skill file contains references to external resources under the same folder.\n5. Load referenced resources only when needed during execution.\n6. Follow the skill's instructions precisely.\n7. After legacy execution, call `invoke_skill` in `wrap_output` mode to normalize the result into SkillResult when a machine-readable Skill output is needed.\n\n**Mandatory Skill Execution Discipline:**\n- Calling `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode is NOT sufficient. It only prepares the selected Skill invocation. After `prepare`, you MUST actually execute the selected Skill workflow.\n- After `invoke_skill(mode=\"prepare\")` returns `legacy_invocation.container_skill_file`, you MUST read that Skill file and treat it as the authoritative execution guide.\n- If the Skill provides scripts, commands, templates, references, or executable workflows, you MUST use those Skill-provided assets first.\n- Do NOT replace a matched Skill workflow with ad hoc Python, pandas, SQL, shell, or manual analysis code before attempting the Skill workflow.\n- For `data-analysis`, if `/mnt/skills/public/data-analysis/scripts/analyze.py` is available and the task is structured data analysis, you MUST call that script first for data inspection, SQL query, aggregation, statistics, or chart preparation. Do not write standalone pandas code for the same operation before trying this script.\n- Custom code is allowed only after one of these conditions is true:\n  1. the selected Skill file does not provide a suitable executable workflow;\n  2. the Skill-provided script or workflow has been attempted and failed;\n  3. the user explicitly requests custom code;\n  4. the required operation is clearly outside the Skill's documented capability.\n- When you fall back to custom code, briefly state that the Skill workflow was insufficient or failed, and continue from the Skill result or error.\n\n**Skill Loading Priority Rules:**\n- If a request clearly matches an available skill and also includes uploaded files, load the skill file before reading uploaded data files.\n- Do NOT read a full uploaded structured data file before loading the matched skill.\n- For uploaded structured data files, use small previews only when needed.\n- Prefer the matched skill's scripts, workflows, or tools for actual analysis.\n- Do not start by generating ad hoc JS, Python, SQL, or shell scripts when a matched skill exists.\n- Only improvise custom code after loading the matched skill and confirming the skill does not already provide a suitable workflow.\n\n**Skills are located at:** /mnt/skills\n\n<available_skills>\n</available_skills>\n\n</skill_system>","additional_kwargs":{"message_type":"routed_skill_prompt","internal":true},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"routing_skill_guidance","id":"613cfa55-5b8b-4323-a428-cff24e0f4c01"},{"content":"<system_reminder>\nUse the following current-turn intent and routing guidance when deciding whether to create or update todos. Treat it as planning context, not as a user request.\n<hidden_step source=\"intent_recognition\" title=\"意图识别\">\n改写后的任务：场景：视频监控。场景ID：video_surveillance\n识别场景：视频监控 (video_surveillance)；场景模式：single；候选场景：video_surveillance\n任务切分：\n- 请统计视频中各时间段的人数，判断是否出现人群聚集、密度突然升高或超过设定阈值的情况。\n任务规划：\n1. 读取输入视频文件并解析元数据，按预设时间粒度将视频流切分为独立帧序列，建立时间戳与图像片段的映射关系，输出结构化时间轴与待处理帧缓存。\n2. 调用视频监控场景的目标检测能力，对每个时间片段执行行人识别与去重计数，统计各时间段内的人员数量指标，输出带时间戳的原始人数时序数据集。\n3. 基于各时段人数与监控画面有效覆盖区域计算人群密度指标，采用滑动窗口法识别密度骤升节点，并将计算结果与预设安全阈值进行比对，标记触发聚集或超限的时间区间及偏差幅度。\n4. 对人数统计与密度研判结果进行逻辑校验与噪声过滤，剔除模型误检或跳变干扰，整合生成包含时间段、实时人数、密度值、阈值状态及异常类型的结构化中间表。\n5. 汇总校验后的时序数据与告警记录，生成可回溯的时间轴分析报告，重点标注人群聚集与密度突增的具体区间，输出最终统计表格与关键指标摘要以供调度决策。\n场景任务：\n- video_surveillance: 我将统计视频中各时间段的人数，并判断是否出现人群聚集、密度突然升高或超过设定阈值的情况。；参数：{'视频对象': '视频', '监控目标': '人数统计、人群聚集、密度突然升高、超过设定阈值', '时间范围': '各时间段'}\n已提取参数：{'视频对象': '视频', '监控目标': '人数统计、人群聚集、密度突然升高、超过设定阈值', '时间范围': '各时间段'}\n任务提示：\n- 提取必填参数：视频对象。需要分析的监控视频、摄像头、视频流、录像文件、实时画面、卡口视频或视频帧\n- 提取可选参数：监控目标。需要识别或分析的对象、行为或事件，如人员聚集、车辆违停、越界、烟火、异常停留、摔倒、入侵、打架、遗留物、通行计数等\n- 提取可选参数：时间范围。视频分析的起止时间、日期、时段、时刻或实时窗口\n- 提取可选参数：输出形式。用户期望的输出，如告警、截图、时间点清单、检测结果、表格、报告、标注说明或风险摘要\n</hidden_step>\n</system_reminder>","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"todo_routing_guidance","id":"befdf7f0-142c-4d42-982a-e05fd56d0dfd"},{"content":"我需要分析视频中的行人数量和聚集情况，但目前缺少关键信息：\n\n**请提供以下信息：**\n\n1. **视频文件路径** - 您想分析的视频文件位于哪个路径？例如：\n   - `/mnt/user-data/uploads/video.mp4`（已上传的视频）\n   - `/mnt/datasets/xxx.mp4`（服务器内置数据集）\n   - 或其他具体路径\n\n2. **时间采样间隔**（可选）- 希望每隔多少秒统计一次人数？默认使用1秒间隔。\n\n3. **人群密度阈值**（可选）- 超过多少人算\"人群聚集\"？如果没有设定，我将自动识别异常峰值。\n\n请先告诉我视频文件的具体路径，我就可以立即开始分析。","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":322,"prompt_tokens":10957,"total_tokens":11279,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":163,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":322},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":10957}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-7feb2ab0-184a-9b8f-9ee5-0f0083e0d437","finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f8f5b-d16b-72e2-858a-40e676279cd4-0","tool_calls":[],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":10957,"output_tokens":322,"total_tokens":11279,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":163}}}],"viewed_images":{},"intent_context":{"intent":"task","original_query":"请统计视频中各时间段的人数，判断是否出现人群聚集、密度突然升高或超过设定阈值的情况。","normalized_query":"请统计视频中各时间段的人数，判断是否出现人群聚集、密度突然升高或超过设定阈值的情况。","routing_query":"场景：视频监控。场景ID：video_surveillance。场景说明：视频监控、摄像头、监控录像、视频流、实时画面、视频帧、卡口、安防巡检、目标检测、行为识别、事件发现和监控告警分析场景。需要识别参数：视频对象、监控目标、时间范围、输出形式。用户原始问题：我将统计视频中各时间段的人数，并判断是否出现人群聚集、密度突然升高或超过设定阈值的情况","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","params":{"视频对象":"视频","监控目标":"人数统计、人群聚集、密度突然升高、超过设定阈值","时间范围":"各时间段"},"scene_mode":"single","scenes":["video_surveillance"],"task_spans":[{"task_span_id":"span_789eb1","text":"请统计视频中各时间段的人数，判断是否出现人群聚集、密度突然升高或超过设定阈值的情况。"}],"planning_steps":[{"task_span_id":"span_64a500","text":"读取输入视频文件并解析元数据，按预设时间粒度将视频流切分为独立帧序列，建立时间戳与图像片段的映射关系，输出结构化时间轴与待处理帧缓存。"},{"task_span_id":"span_ffcc77","text":"调用视频监控场景的目标检测能力，对每个时间片段执行行人识别与去重计数，统计各时间段内的人员数量指标，输出带时间戳的原始人数时序数据集。"},{"task_span_id":"span_a5e9ea","text":"基于各时段人数与监控画面有效覆盖区域计算人群密度指标，采用滑动窗口法识别密度骤升节点，并将计算结果与预设安全阈值进行比对，标记触发聚集或超限的时间区间及偏差幅度。"},{"task_span_id":"span_a4ab2f","text":"对人数统计与密度研判结果进行逻辑校验与噪声过滤，剔除模型误检或跳变干扰，整合生成包含时间段、实时人数、密度值、阈值状态及异常类型的结构化中间表。"},{"task_span_id":"span_957d74","text":"汇总校验后的时序数据与告警记录，生成可回溯的时间轴分析报告，重点标注人群聚集与密度突增的具体区间，输出最终统计表格与关键指标摘要以供调度决策。"}],"scene_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_ea7ba9","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"我将统计视频中各时间段的人数，并判断是否出现人群聚集、密度突然升高或超过设定阈值的情况。","params":{"视频对象":"视频","监控目标":"人数统计、人群聚集、密度突然升高、超过设定阈值","时间范围":"各时间段"}}],"sub_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_ea7ba9","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"我将统计视频中各时间段的人数，并判断是否出现人群聚集、密度突然升高或超过设定阈值的情况。","params":{"视频对象":"视频","监控目标":"人数统计、人群聚集、密度突然升高、超过设定阈值","时间范围":"各时间段"}}],"task_hints":["提取必填参数：视频对象。需要分析的监控视频、摄像头、视频流、录像文件、实时画面、卡口视频或视频帧","提取可选参数：监控目标。需要识别或分析的对象、行为或事件，如人员聚集、车辆违停、越界、烟火、异常停留、摔倒、入侵、打架、遗留物、通行计数等","提取可选参数：时间范围。视频分析的起止时间、日期、时段、时刻或实时窗口","提取可选参数：输出形式。用户期望的输出，如告警、截图、时间点清单、检测结果、表格、报告、标注说明或风险摘要"],"mentioned_skill_ids":[],"confidence":0.9,"reason":"llm_scene_slot_rewrite","_source_message_key":"id:ce4a52fb-fb88-4a4e-8a57-0645cb3ab70a"},"routing_context":{"route_mode":"scene_filter","trigger":false,"primary_goal":"请统计视频中各时间段的人数，判断是否出现人群聚集、密度突然升高或超过设定阈值的情况。","scene_tasks":[{"scene_task_id":"task_001","segment_id":"seg_001","segment_text":"请统计视频中各时间段的人数，判断是否出现人群聚集、密度突然升高或超过设定阈值的情况。","scene":"video_surveillance","input_refs":[],"task_types":[],"selected_skills":[],"expected_outputs":[],"depends_on":[]}],"global_selected_skills":[],"default_public_skill_ids":[],"global_allowed_tools":[],"confidence":0.0,"route_reason":"SkillRouter disabled; injected all custom skills for detected intent scene as LeadAgent candidate skills","allowed_skills":[],"selection_owner":"lead_agent","_source_message_key":"id:ce4a52fb-fb88-4a4e-8a57-0645cb3ab70a"},"dialogue_context":{"act":"new_task","confidence":0.7,"reason":"no_pending_action_match","parsed_answer":null,"pending_action_id":null,"resume_intent_context":null,"resume_routing_context":null,"metadata":{}},"final_scope_skill_ids":[],"allowed_tool_name